1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,170
帕梅隆·塔克 你做的这些饼干和肉汁
Pameron Tucker, you outdid yourself

2
00:00:02,170 --> 00:00:03,490
完全超越了自我
on these biscuits and gravy.

3
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:04,300
太好吃了
They are so tasty,

4
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,460
好吃到想让你打咱妈[俚语]
they make you want to slap your mama.

5
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,370
我说得对吗 米奇尔
Am I right, Mitchell?

6
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:07,930
当然 如果真有这么个说法 肯定的
Sure. If that's a thing, why not?

7
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:08,960
愿主保佑
Bless your hearts.

8
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,210
我饱到要炸了[俚语]
I'm fuller than a dog tick.

9
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:12,250
不要因为他们那么说...
Hey, just because they do it...

10
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,570
这是我的一点小心意
It's the least I could do,

11
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:15,270
自从你俩为我敞开大门
since you'uns opened your home to me

12
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:17,110
照顾了我不知道多少星期
for I don't know how many weeks now.

13
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:17,620
三星期
Three.

14
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:19,100
我就想不明白了
I just don't get it.

15
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,290
-他怎么能抛下我 -我懂
- How could he leave me? - I know.

16
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,690
我这么漂亮
I'm pretty.

17
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:25,100
他在床上爱怎么来我都随他
There's nothing I won't let him do in the b-e-d.

18
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,960
亲爱的 你吃了不少哦 是吧
Hey, sweetheart, you're such a big eater, aren't ya, huh?

19
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,270
不敢相信我竟然被抛弃了
I can't believe I got left.

20
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:31,880
抛弃了
Left!

21
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,340
所以 小帕被抛弃了
So, Pam got left.

22
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,690
她丈夫博趁她在龙卷风后 把转晕了的小猪
Her husband, Bo, took off with half their stuff

23
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:38,400
赶回猪圈的时候 拿着他们一半的东西走人了
when she was out rounding up dazed piglets after a twister.

24
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,410
我没开玩笑
I'm not kidding.

25
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,050
我坚持让她跟我们住在一起
I insisted she stay with us

26
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:43,620
这样我可以帮她重树自信
so I could help build up her confidence again.

27
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:45,280
小帕的自我价值一直以来
Pam's self-worth has always been

28
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,760
都以是否得到男人的注意为准
tied to the attention of men.

29
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:47,450
这个 你懂的
Which, you know,

30
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:49,580
让莉莉看到也许不太好吧
maybe isn't the best thing for Lily to witness.

31
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,710
-你在说什么 -没 没什么
- What are you talking about? - N-Nothing.

32
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:53,870
可能只是我胡思乱想吧
I'm probably just imagining it.

33
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,340
我才没有胡思乱想
I'm not imagining it.

34
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,620
也许是他
It could be him!

35
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,980
可能是他 大家伙儿 可能是他打来了
That could be him, you guys! It could be him!

36
00:00:58,990 --> 00:00:59,770
滚
Get!

37
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:01,740
可能是他 可能是他
That could be him! It could be him!

38
00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:03,110
不是他
It's not him.

39
00:01:20,090 --> 00:01:21,750
这比我在两年制大学度过的三年里
Wow, this is more reading than I did

40
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:23,230
读的东西还要多
in my three years at a two-year college.

41
00:01:23,230 --> 00:01:25,520
我想要辣酱热狗
I'm thinking chili dog,

42
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:27,460
就是我老爸给我买过的那种 愿他安息
just like Pops -- may he rest in peace --

43
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:29,630
他在我看人生第一场棒球赛时给我买过辣酱热狗
bought me at my first baseball game.

44
00:01:29,630 --> 00:01:30,830
我能说实话[香肠]吗
May I be frank?

45
00:01:30,830 --> 00:01:31,960
我们有熏肠[下体]哦
We have a wiener.

46
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:33,830
怪怪的但是很贴心
Oh, that's so weirdly sweet.

47
00:01:33,830 --> 00:01:35,700
你的头发纹丝不动好可爱啊
And it's so cute how your hair never moves.

48
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:36,800
简直像乐高
It's like a LEGO.

49
00:01:37,070 --> 00:01:39,180
我认识你
Hey, I know you!

50
00:01:39,410 --> 00:01:42,480
科切拉音乐节 你还在我的货车上跳舞来着
Coachella, dancing on top of my van.

51
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:44,310
不是啦 只是我看起来像那种...
No, I just have one of those faces that --

52
00:01:44,310 --> 00:01:45,580
你是海莉吧
It's Haley, right?

53
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:48,090
海莉 你要介绍我们认识一下吗
Haley, would you like to introduce us?

54
00:01:48,090 --> 00:01:49,130
好吧
Um, okay.

55
00:01:49,130 --> 00:01:51,540
这是我男朋友安迪 这是...
Andy, my boyfriend, this is...

56
00:01:51,540 --> 00:01:52,500
-汤姆 -汤姆
- Tom. - Tom.

57
00:01:52,730 --> 00:01:53,580
汤姆 汤姆
Tom Tom.

58
00:01:53,580 --> 00:01:55,150
你是切罗基人吗
Is that Cherokee?

59
00:01:55,150 --> 00:01:58,160
-我该 -再见
- I should -- - Bye.

60
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,250
对不起
I'm sorry.

61
00:02:01,250 --> 00:02:04,170
我知道你是比我野了点
Hey, I know that you're a little wilder than I am.

62
00:02:04,170 --> 00:02:06,500
这也是我爱上你的原因之一 有点小激动呢
It's one of the reasons I fell for you. It's exciting.

63
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:07,840
你没必要说这些来安慰我
You don't have to say that.

64
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,850
不 我是认真的
No, I mean it.

65
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:12,500
这样吧 别吃晚饭看电影了
You know what? Let's forget about dinner and a movie.

66
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:15,520
我们来干点狂野海莉会做的事情
Let's do what Wild Haley would do instead.

67
00:02:16,290 --> 00:02:18,040
说真的 我已经基本准备
Honestly, I've been kind of ready

68
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:20,400
要把狂野海莉的派对专用鞋扔掉了
for Wild Haley to chuck her party pumps in the trash.

69
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:22,780
或者捐给慈善机构 随便啦
Or give them to charity, blah, blah, blah -- whatever.

70
00:02:22,780 --> 00:02:25,030
但如果那是安迪喜欢我的原因之一
But if that's one of the things that Andy liked about me,

71
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:26,760
我就不会改掉
I wasn't gonna shut it down.

72
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:28,090
好吧 我们可以先去
Okay, well, we can start

73
00:02:28,090 --> 00:02:30,190
一个西边的酒吧 我认识那里的酒保
at this western place where I know the bartender.

74
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,910
如果你躲起来 我可以弄到一整晚的免费酒喝
If you hang back, I can get us free drinks all night.

75
00:02:31,910 --> 00:02:32,690
不会觉得奇怪吗
It won't look weird,

76
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:34,540
每次过去你都点两杯酒
you ordering two drinks every time you go up?

77
00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:35,500
不会
No.

78
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:38,360
那就燥起来吧
Then let's turn this mother out.

79
00:02:39,070 --> 00:02:40,750
我一下子
I got pretty lucky

80
00:02:40,750 --> 00:02:43,010
想到那句话还挺走运的
pulling that expression out of my fanny.

81
00:02:43,010 --> 00:02:45,310
我向来不擅长这种派对
I'm not usually so quick with party talk,

82
00:02:45,310 --> 00:02:47,130
但我总担心
but I've always had this fear

83
00:02:47,130 --> 00:02:48,870
海莉会觉得我跟不上她
that Haley would think I couldn't keep up with her,

84
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:51,540
所以我只要尽力待上一整晚
so I just tried to survive the night

85
00:02:51,540 --> 00:02:54,010
然后不要吐在我老爸的旧教堂衫上就行
and not barf on my dad's old church shirt.

86
00:02:56,250 --> 00:02:57,030
克莱尔
Claire?

87
00:02:58,860 --> 00:02:59,680
克莱尔
Claire?

88
00:03:00,730 --> 00:03:01,570
克莱尔
Claire?

89
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:03,280
我们能开始看电影了吗
Can we watch the movie now?

90
00:03:03,450 --> 00:03:04,800
-亲爱的 -回答他
- Honey? - Answer him!

91
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:07,010
亲爱的 拜托 我得把这个提议搞定先
Honey, please. I just have to approve this proposal.

92
00:03:07,010 --> 00:03:08,800
我已经花了一整周时间了
I've been working on it all week.

93
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:11,250
我的天哪
Oh...my...God.

94
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:14,400
没错 妈妈的帝国日不落
That's right. Sun never sets on Mama's empire.

95
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,520
不是啦 你还记得我们注册的那个
No, remember the travel app we signed up for

96
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,550
推荐最后一刻折扣的应用吗
that gives you the last-minute deals?

97
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:21,520
巴黎三晚加头等舱
Three nights in Paris, first-class airfare,

98
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:24,280
加四星级酒店 几乎等于不用钱啊
four-star hotel for basically nothing.

99
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,150
飞机明天中午就飞了
The flight leaves at noon tomorrow.

100
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:28,050
我们只有五分钟时间决定
We have five minutes to answer.

101
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,840
等等 你不是真的在考虑吧
Wait. You're not seriously considering this, are you?

102
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,200
简直是世纪大折扣啊
It's kind of the deal of the century.

103
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,630
而且 我们只要请一天假就行了
Plus, we'd only miss one day of work.

104
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,800
海莉跟安迪在一起 卢克去滑雪了
Haley's with Andy. Luke's on a ski trip.

105
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,660
我没关系啊
I don't matter.

106
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:39,000
亲爱的 我们到那里的时候
Oh, sweetie, by the time we got there,

107
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,020
我们会因为倒时差累死的
we would be so messed up on the time change,

108
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:43,950
我们只会在恶心的雾里四处乱逛而已
we would just wander around in, like, a nauseous fog.

109
00:03:43,950 --> 00:03:45,250
或者你也可以逼你自己
Or you could just force yourselves

110
00:03:45,250 --> 00:03:46,540
今晚通宵
to stay up all night tonight,

111
00:03:46,540 --> 00:03:47,750
然后明天在飞机上睡觉
then sleep on the plane tomorrow,

112
00:03:47,750 --> 00:03:49,130
这样等你到了巴黎后
and then when you land in Paris,

113
00:03:49,130 --> 00:03:50,860
你过的就是正常的巴黎时间
your morning will be Paris' morning.

114
00:03:50,890 --> 00:03:51,670
听听吧
There we go!

115
00:03:51,670 --> 00:03:53,740
我们太幸运了 还好是最聪明的在家
Lucky for us, the smart one's home.

116
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,280
这主意多好
It's such a sweet idea,

117
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:58,180
但我这礼拜上班太累了
but I am so tired from work this week.

118
00:03:58,190 --> 00:04:01,000
还有什么比春天的巴黎更能给人动力的吗
What is more energizing than springtime in Paris?

119
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:04,640
飘香的法棍 有趣的哑剧 相爱的臭鼬
Baguettes baking, mimes miming, skunks in love.

120
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:06,170
这才是生活
This is what life is.

121
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:07,900
-这才是生活[法语] 好吗 -不
- C'est la vie, right? - Nope.

122
00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:08,970
不亦乐乎[法语]
Joie de vivre.

123
00:04:08,970 --> 00:04:09,930
好一点
Better.

124
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:12,850
听我说 有一天我们会老到
Look, someday, watching movies on the couch

125
00:04:12,850 --> 00:04:14,080
只能在沙发上看电影
is the only thing we'll be able to do,

126
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:17,200
但现在 我们要开一枪
but right now, let's fire a warning shot

127
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,890
警告时间老人
right through Father Time's beard

128
00:04:18,890 --> 00:04:20,710
然后在不朽之城度过一个周末
and spend a weekend in the Eternal City.

129
00:04:20,710 --> 00:04:21,570
那是罗马
Rome.

130
00:04:21,930 --> 00:04:22,840
翡翠城
Emerald City.

131
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:23,650
西雅图或者绿野仙踪
Seattle or Oz.

132
00:04:23,650 --> 00:04:25,720
她知道我说的是哪里 快没时间了
She knows where I mean, and the clock's running!

133
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,200
你真的想去吗
You really want to do this, don't you?

134
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:29,770
我们周二回来时就会有终身难忘的回忆
We'd be back Tuesday with the story of a lifetime.

135
00:04:30,170 --> 00:04:31,520
快按下橘色按钮
Press the orange square.

136
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:36,070
快按下橘色按钮[法语]
Pressez-vous le square orange.

137
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:39,420
太好了 我们要去啦
Yeah! We're doing it!

138
00:04:40,010 --> 00:04:41,570
抱歉 睡眠先生 你得等等了
Sorry, sleep! You'll have to wait!

139
00:04:41,570 --> 00:04:43,720
我要把时间调到巴黎时间
We're setting our watches to Paris time,

140
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,820
那就是
which is...

141
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,810
比我们早九小时
Nine hours ahead.

142
00:04:45,820 --> 00:04:47,780
好了 现在是晚上九点半 换算过去是
Okay. Okay, it's 9:30 right now...

143
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,020
数学老师哭了 早上六点半
Oh, my God! 6:30.

144
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,320
要多长时间才能卸完妆啊
How long's it take to get the makeup off?

145
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:58,010
我撤出西贡[越战战场]都比你这快
I got out of Saigon faster.

146
00:04:58,010 --> 00:04:59,680
你喜欢那个女人每天早上出门时的样子
You like what walks out the door every morning,

147
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,900
那就别抱怨过程了
so don't complain about the process.

148
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:02,210
我车库里有台地板打磨机
I got a floor sander in the garage

149
00:05:02,210 --> 00:05:03,920
如果那样能更快点让我用浴室的话
if it'll open up the bathroom sooner.

150
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:05,360
有点不方便是吧 杰
Aw, feeling a little put-out, Jay?

151
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,900
这是我的浴室 记得吗
It's my bathroom, remember?

152
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,000
曼尼 那里没痘痘
Manny, there's no pimple there.

153
00:05:09,010 --> 00:05:11,410
是闭口型的 我都能感觉到在跳
It's the underground kind. I can feel my heartbeat in it.

154
00:05:11,410 --> 00:05:15,020
我退休了 需要给自己找点事做
I retired. I needed a little project.

155
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:18,030
所以我决定装修一下主卧的洗手间
So I decided to redo our master bathroom.

156
00:05:18,150 --> 00:05:19,830
是啊 要是有人警告过你
Yeah, if only someone had told you

157
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:22,530
这件事比在YouTube上看起来
that it was going to be harder and longer

158
00:05:22,530 --> 00:05:24,700
难多了也费时多了就好了
than it looked on YouTube.

159
00:05:24,990 --> 00:05:26,150
但我警告过你了
Oh, wait!

160
00:05:26,150 --> 00:05:28,300
如果你能按我贴在两个地方的
If you just followed the simple bathroom schedule

161
00:05:28,310 --> 00:05:30,510
英西双语洗手间使用日程来使用
I posted in two places in English and Spanish...

162
00:05:30,510 --> 00:05:31,940
谁会做这种事
Yes, who does that?

163
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:34,260
谁会给家人发使用日程
Who puts a schedule up for their family?

164
00:05:34,370 --> 00:05:35,430
别进去
Uh, don't go in there.

165
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:37,450
我要去拿美颜[消失]霜 我找不到了
I need to get my vanishing cream. I can't find it.

166
00:05:37,450 --> 00:05:38,460
挺有效果的
Must've worked.

167
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,820
真搞笑 我忘记
So funny, I forgot to --

168
00:05:43,350 --> 00:05:45,520
淋浴间怎么了
What happened to the shower?!

169
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,800
不是做好了吗
It was finished!

170
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:49,200
我重做了 我不太喜欢砖缝的样子
I started over. I wasn't loving the grout.

171
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:51,210
这至少又要花一周
This is gonna take at least one more week.

172
00:05:51,210 --> 00:05:52,340
别弄得自己不开心
Don't upset yourself.

173
00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:55,140
不 是你让我不开心的
No, you are upsetting myself!

174
00:05:55,140 --> 00:05:56,990
今晚你睡沙发
And you're gonna go and sleep on the couch.

175
00:05:56,990 --> 00:05:57,900
你说真的吗
Are you serious?

176
00:05:58,350 --> 00:05:59,110
好吧
Fine.

177
00:06:00,050 --> 00:06:00,990
你在干什么
What are you doing?

178
00:06:01,810 --> 00:06:02,870
里面是刚铺的沥青
That's fresh tar in there.

179
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:04,520
你想整晚闻着那个味儿睡吗
You really want to smell that all night long?

180
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:07,060
关于这个洗手间我只做一个决定
I get to make one decision about this bathroom.

181
00:06:07,060 --> 00:06:09,030
把门开着
The door stays open!

182
00:06:09,030 --> 00:06:09,980
好吧
Fine.

183
00:06:10,210 --> 00:06:12,430
洗手间装修给我造成了很多困扰
Um, in all the bathroom confusion,

184
00:06:12,430 --> 00:06:13,780
我吃的好像不是多维片
instead of my multivitamin,

185
00:06:13,780 --> 00:06:15,680
而是避孕药
I may have taken a birth-control pill.

186
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,900
我觉得没事
I think you'll be fine.

187
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:20,180
反正我今晚也不需要
And anyways, for sure I won't be needing one tonight!

188
00:06:20,610 --> 00:06:21,250
可能是药物作用
It may be the pill,

189
00:06:21,250 --> 00:06:23,240
我现在感觉有点受伤
but I'm feeling a little attacked right now.

190
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:30,770
火还没灭你就喝了吗
Did you drink that while it was still on fire?

191
00:06:30,780 --> 00:06:32,200
旧习惯了
It's an old habit.

192
00:06:32,470 --> 00:06:33,880
我之前就是这么吃烤棉花糖的
It's how I used to eat my marshmallows.

193
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:35,750
我喜欢这个男人
I love this guy.

194
00:06:35,750 --> 00:06:37,350
你也好漂亮啊
And you're so pretty.

195
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,100
真高兴认识你们
It's really good meeting you two.

196
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:42,010
海莉 跟比安卡舌吻我就给你20块
Haley, I'll give you 20 bucks to make out with Bianca.

197
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:44,200
20块
20 bucks?

198
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:46,190
比安卡抽烟 我不喜欢
So, Bianca's a smoker. Didn't love that.

199
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,170
她还喜欢乱摸
Or the wandering hands.

200
00:06:47,170 --> 00:06:50,230
不过这些都是"疯狂版海莉"的一部分
But it's all a part of the Wild Haley experience.

201
00:06:55,460 --> 00:06:56,310
天哪
God!

202
00:06:57,340 --> 00:06:58,210
不是吧
No!

203
00:07:01,710 --> 00:07:03,920
12秒 挺不错的
12 seconds! Not bad!

204
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,590
超有意思
And it was so fun.

205
00:07:05,590 --> 00:07:06,820
所以我一直在尖叫
That's why I was screaming.

206
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:09,150
今晚太棒了
Wow, what a night, huh?

207
00:07:09,150 --> 00:07:10,460
可惜已经这么晚了
Sucks it's so late.

208
00:07:10,630 --> 00:07:11,760
对我们要去的地方来说并不晚
Not where we're going.

209
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:14,120
我知道你的意思 赌城
I know that look -- Vegas!

210
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:15,630
来吧 要去吗
Come on! You in?

211
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,060
总的来说
Turtle-y!

212
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:19,020
我喜欢这主意
I love this idea.

213
00:07:19,020 --> 00:07:21,520
我也是 我还怕今晚就这么结束了
Me too! I was scared we were done.

214
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,320
走吧
Let's go.

215
00:07:24,470 --> 00:07:25,910
我腿有点软
That's some tender meats.

216
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:30,860
我生气时会睡不着 一直都是
I can't sleep when I'm angry. Never could.

217
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:34,050
那些能睡着的人一定有问题
And there's something very wrong with people who can.

218
00:07:43,820 --> 00:07:46,130
你这么晚发邮件是想干嘛
What are you doing sending e-mails this time of night?

219
00:07:47,350 --> 00:07:48,170
真的吗
Really?

220
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:50,660
你想要人陪
You want some company?

221
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:53,590
歌洛莉亚在适应我更多的存在感
Gloria's just adjusting to me being around more.

222
00:07:53,660 --> 00:07:55,970
我们老是妨碍到对方
We're on top of each other -- and not in a good way.

223
00:07:55,970 --> 00:07:58,720
有意思 我还以为你们的性生活会变好呢
Oh, fun. I was hoping your sex life would come up.

224
00:07:58,970 --> 00:08:01,340
爸 重新装修不容易
Look, Dad, remodels are tense.

225
00:08:01,340 --> 00:08:03,930
我处理的离婚官司一半都是装修引发的
Half the divorces I do start with a remodel.

226
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:05,470
或者内衣模特[谐音]
Or an underwear model.

227
00:08:05,470 --> 00:08:06,460
你需要点什么吗
Can I get you anything?

228
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:07,900
-你知道"鲁宾三明治"是什么吗 -知道
- You know what a Reuben is? - Yes.

229
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:08,740
不 你不知道
No, you don't.

230
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:10,330
"鲁宾三明治"是这么做的
This is a Reuben.

231
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:12,650
面包和腌牛肉是分开烤的
You grill the bread and the corned beef separately.

232
00:08:12,650 --> 00:08:13,680
我说的是腌牛肉
Now, I said "corned beef."

233
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,340
就像马提尼里面没有伏特加
There's no vodka in a martini.

234
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:16,880
鲁宾三明治里也不放熏牛肉
There's no pastrami in a Reuben.

235
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:17,800
你把它们放到一起
You put 'em together.

236
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:20,400
然后是德国酸菜 瑞士奶酪和俄式调味酱
Then you have 'kraut, Swiss, Russian.

237
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:22,350
轴心国 中立国 盟友
Axis, neutral, Ally.

238
00:08:22,350 --> 00:08:23,240
就是这么记得
That's how you remember.

239
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:25,810
知道了 罗德里格 7号
Got it. Roderigo! Number siete!

240
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:27,020
今天大家都怎么了
What's with people today?

241
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:28,200
人就是这样的
Yeah, it's totally people.

242
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:30,960
爸 你别这么激动
Look, Dad, you get so worked up.

243
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:33,030
你应该跟我学学
You should try doing this thing that I'm doing

244
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:35,060
我决定不让任何事情影响我的心情
where I just decide not to let things bother me.

245
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:35,880
-真的吗 是的
- Really? - Yep.

246
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,940
所以你才半夜一个人来这里吗
That's why you're here alone in the middle of the night?

247
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:38,720
现在在家工作
It's just a little hard

248
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,650
感觉有点艰难
to get work done at my house right now.

249
00:08:40,650 --> 00:08:41,230
每年一次
So, once a year,

250
00:08:41,230 --> 00:08:43,190
空气中会出现某种花粉
some sort of pollen is released into the air,

251
00:08:43,190 --> 00:08:46,280
所以有两个星期小卡睡觉都会
and for two weeks, Cam has allergy-induced sleep apnea

252
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:49,000
带着帮助呼吸的仪器以免过敏窒息
and has to use an apparatus in order to help him breathe.

253
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,490
会很丑吗
Is it hideous?

254
00:08:50,490 --> 00:08:51,560
什么很丑
Is what hideous?

255
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,910
我都没注意到有东西
I barely even noticed it.

256
00:08:57,270 --> 00:09:00,470
问题是 小帕有一样的毛病
What's challenging is, Pam has the same condition.

257
00:09:02,550 --> 00:09:04,430
我以为如果能把两人频率调成一致
I thought that maybe I could focus

258
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:06,950
我应该就能不受影响了
if I could get those contraptions in sync.

259
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:14,260
你干嘛还要插回去
Why did you plug it back in?

260
00:09:14,260 --> 00:09:15,130
好笑
Charming.

261
00:09:15,130 --> 00:09:17,680
和你不同 我没生气 也没引起争吵
No, unlike you, I didn't engage, and I avoided a fight.

262
00:09:17,690 --> 00:09:19,330
所以我这边一点事都没有
So all is well on my side of the street.

263
00:09:19,330 --> 00:09:22,340
米奇尔 你的键盘上
Mitchell, there's a pile of little orange hairs

264
00:09:22,340 --> 00:09:23,620
掉了一堆红毛
on your keyboard.

265
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,100
你又开始拔眉毛了
You're picking your eyebrows again.

266
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:26,630
我当年送你去少年棒球队的时候你也这样
Like you did when I put you in Little League.

267
00:09:26,630 --> 00:09:28,160
好吧 我有点压力
Okay, I am a little stressed.

268
00:09:28,170 --> 00:09:29,910
不过都是因为 我工作太多了
But it's just 'cause I'm -- I'm buried under work.

269
00:09:29,910 --> 00:09:32,930
而且小卡的姐姐对莉莉有很大的负面影响
And Cam's sister is the worst influence on Lily.

270
00:09:32,930 --> 00:09:35,980
可我不能吼她 因为她太能哭了
But I-I can't yell at her because she's a sopping mess.

271
00:09:35,990 --> 00:09:37,840
所以我该朝谁吼
So, you know, who am I supposed to yell at?

272
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,570
我那需要机器帮助呼吸的丈夫吗
My husband, who needs a machine to breathe?

273
00:09:39,570 --> 00:09:41,780
你最好找个发泄的途径
Well, you better find yourself an outlet.

274
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:44,510
所以我喝威士忌打高尔夫抽雪茄
That's why I have scotch and golf and cigars.

275
00:09:44,510 --> 00:09:46,530
不然我一定已经炸了
Otherwise, I'd be a raging jackass.

276
00:09:46,530 --> 00:09:48,220
-我们没有燕麦面包了 -那就去烤
- We're out of rye. - Then bake some!

277
00:09:48,220 --> 00:09:49,180
你能别冲给我们端食物的
Can you please not yell at the woman

278
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:50,250
女人吼吗
who's bringing us our food?

279
00:09:50,250 --> 00:09:52,080
我们的食物 别说了 太恶心了
I -- our food -- Stop that. That's gross!

280
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,910
桌子像被狐狸踩过一样
It's like a fox ran across the table.

281
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:54,900
我们走吧
We're out of here.

282
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:55,850
不 我还得工作
No, I have work to do.

283
00:09:55,850 --> 00:09:57,870
不 你得好好发泄一下
No, you got to blow off some steam.

284
00:09:57,870 --> 00:10:00,000
好吧 感觉跟少年棒球队好像
O-Okay, this sounds a lot like Little League.

285
00:10:00,170 --> 00:10:02,220
我们最好别真去击球笼
We better not be going to a batting cage.

286
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:04,180
现在千万别往我手里塞棒子
You do not want to put a bat in my hands right now.

287
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:05,340
说得好像你能打到我一样
Like you could hit me.

288
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,460
走吧
Let's go.

289
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:10,310
醒醒 我们要去法国了
Out of that trance! We're going to France!

290
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:12,850
我只是在打哈欠 这都早上2点半了
I can yawn. It's 2:30 in the morning.

291
00:10:12,850 --> 00:10:16,560
不 女士 现在是早上11点半
Mais non, mademoiselle! It's 11:30 in the morning.

292
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:17,950
辛苦你啦
Thanks for doing these.

293
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:18,710
好啦
Yeah.

294
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:20,660
-我说过... -你说过了
- Did I mention that -- - Yes, you did --

295
00:10:20,660 --> 00:10:22,830
如果你睡裤穿得足够低
that if you wear your sweatpants low enough,

296
00:10:22,830 --> 00:10:25,390
今晚我就会看见伦敦和法国
tonight, I will see London, I will see France,

297
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:28,480
然后 我就看到你的内裤了
and then, yes, I will see your underpants.

298
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,170
菲尔
Phil!

299
00:10:29,180 --> 00:10:30,080
你睡着了
You're asleep!

300
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,670
不 不 不
Oh, no, no, no!

301
00:10:31,670 --> 00:10:32,920
没问题 我们可以小睡一下
It's fine. We can take a nap.

302
00:10:32,930 --> 00:10:35,110
欧洲人经常打瞌睡
Europeans are always napping.

303
00:10:35,110 --> 00:10:36,750
好吧 没什么比做这个更糟了
Actually, that's the worst thing you can do.

304
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:38,030
她说的没错 克莱尔 振作点
She's right, Claire. Get up.

305
00:10:38,030 --> 00:10:39,230
你为什么还醒着
Why are you still awake?

306
00:10:39,230 --> 00:10:40,810
太兴奋睡不着了
I'm too excited to sleep.

307
00:10:40,810 --> 00:10:42,430
我在学习大爆炸核聚变的...
I'm studying Big Bang nucleosynthesis --

308
00:10:42,430 --> 00:10:44,220
更确切地说
well, more specifically

309
00:10:44,230 --> 00:10:46,290
是宇宙中的重子物质总量
the total Baryonic matter in the universe.

310
00:10:46,290 --> 00:10:46,930
言归正传
Let's go back.

311
00:10:46,930 --> 00:10:48,120
暗物质和暗能量的比重
Dark matter and dark energy

312
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:50,860
占所有物质的95%
make up 95% of all of the matter in the --

313
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:52,560
-不 走开 -别念了
- No! Go away! - Stop!

314
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,490
我们需要帮助
We needed help.

315
00:10:53,490 --> 00:10:56,910
如何保持清醒网站上第一条毫无疑问就是
And no surprise, first entry on howtostayawake.net --

316
00:10:56,910 --> 00:10:57,760
咖啡
coffee.

317
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,410
-果然有用 -要的就这效果
- This did it. - This is all we needed.

318
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,510
-来帮我按按脚吧 -那你也按按我的
- You want to rub my feet? - If you rub mine.

319
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:03,100
菲尔
Phil!

320
00:11:03,410 --> 00:11:05,770
脚 我们为什么要按脚
The feet! Why'd we do the feet?!

321
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:08,820
第二条 保持运动状态
Second tip -- stay active.

322
00:11:12,770 --> 00:11:13,880
你才睡着了呢
You're asleep!

323
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:16,350
最后我们终于找了有效的方法
Finally, we found something that worked.

324
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,220
对我有效
For me.

325
00:11:18,190 --> 00:11:20,280
不 搞什么鬼
No! What the hell?!

326
00:11:23,340 --> 00:11:25,360
我的亲娘啊
Oh, my nana!

327
00:11:30,190 --> 00:11:31,950
我们去溜达一下找点东西吃怎么样
What do you say we take a walk and get something to eat?

328
00:11:31,950 --> 00:11:33,290
现在是法国的午餐时间
It is French lunchtime.

329
00:11:33,290 --> 00:11:34,820
好啊 值得一试
Sure. It's worth a shot.

330
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,690
走之前我还有点事
Got to do something first.

331
00:11:39,330 --> 00:11:40,320
搞什么
Why?!

332
00:11:40,330 --> 00:11:41,910
干吗乱吓人
Why would you do that?!

333
00:11:43,710 --> 00:11:44,780
我的意思就是
Alls I'm saying is,

334
00:11:44,780 --> 00:11:47,280
如果能幸运地遇到你喜欢的这个莱恩
if you're lucky enough to get this boy Ryan you like,

335
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,790
就要好好把握
you hold on with both hands.

336
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,570
他一旦离开 你就什么都不是了
'Cause once he's gone, you're nothing.

337
00:11:50,580 --> 00:11:52,180
好吧 你不是这个意思
Okay, you don't really mean that.

338
00:11:52,180 --> 00:11:53,510
我也不知道我什么意思
I don't know what I mean.

339
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:55,680
我只是满嘴跑火车而已
I'm just a woman running her fool mouth off.

340
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:57,710
这些自我主导的信息跟我们想教给
Okay, not exactly the message of empowerment

341
00:11:57,710 --> 00:12:00,480
21世纪生的女儿的不一样
we'd like to impart to our 21st-century daughter.

342
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,710
杜冷丁针剂是什么
What's a Demerol shooter?

343
00:12:01,710 --> 00:12:04,320
好了 我说 咱们声音小点
Okay, you know what? Let's keep our voices down.

344
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:06,340
我可不想把别人吵醒证明谁是对的
We don't want anyone woken up and proven correct.

345
00:12:06,340 --> 00:12:07,010
给我
Give me that.

346
00:12:07,010 --> 00:12:08,340
-再抽一口 -不行 别抽了
- One more drag! - No. Stop.

347
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:10,020
它能把我怎么样 害死我吗
What's the worst it's gonna do? Kill me?

348
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:11,560
别抽了
Stop...it!

349
00:12:11,710 --> 00:12:13,430
那根是我卷的
Hey, I rolled that!

350
00:12:14,470 --> 00:12:15,560
妈妈
Mama!

351
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:16,920
妈妈
Mama!

352
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:18,260
妈妈
Mama!

353
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:19,250
干吗
What?!

354
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:21,390
对不起 对不起 是你啊 宝贝
Sorry, sorry. It's you, Papi.

355
00:12:21,390 --> 00:12:22,210
怎么了
What's wrong?

356
00:12:22,210 --> 00:12:23,480
能不能拜托你去看看乔
Can you please deal with Joe?

357
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,800
再去看看治疗师
And also get a therapist?

358
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:25,870
妈妈
Mama!

359
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:29,680
声音不是从他卧室传来的
That is not coming from his bedroom.

360
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:30,810
妈妈
Mama!

361
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:32,370
哦不
Oh, no!

362
00:12:35,820 --> 00:12:39,320
我刚才想喝水 然后就被粘在这了
I wanted a glass of water, and I got stuck.

363
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,120
真该死
Damn it!

364
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:43,970
我怎么不关门呢 关了你就不会
Why didn't I close that door so you didn't get stuck

365
00:12:43,970 --> 00:12:46,570
像曼尼的沙鼠那样被粘住了
like Manny's gerbil in the glue trap?!

366
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:47,940
可你说它逃走了
But you said he ran away.

367
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:49,940
是啊 它的大部分是逃走了
Yes, most of him did.

368
00:12:50,180 --> 00:12:51,250
把鞋脱了
Take off your slippers.

369
00:12:51,250 --> 00:12:52,110
对 好主意
Oh, yeah, good idea.

370
00:12:52,110 --> 00:12:53,870
可别把鞋弄脏
Don't want anything bad to happen to them.

371
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:54,730
好的
Okay.

372
00:12:55,060 --> 00:12:55,840
等等 你这是干什么
Wait! What are you doing?!

373
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,780
你疯了吗 这皮是佛罗伦萨的
Are you crazy?! They're Florentine leather!

374
00:12:57,780 --> 00:12:59,620
曼尼 我们只是说说而已
Ay, Manny, that's what we just told you.

375
00:12:59,630 --> 00:13:00,900
这在中国城买的
We got them in Chinatown.

376
00:13:00,900 --> 00:13:02,440
好了 小小乔
Okay, Little Joe.

377
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:05,190
这就把你弄起来
Let's get you out of there.

378
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:06,990
起来
Okay, come on!

379
00:13:07,020 --> 00:13:07,840
好了 好了
Okay. Ay.

380
00:13:08,110 --> 00:13:09,700
我们得把睡衣
Now we're gonna burn these pajamas

381
00:13:09,700 --> 00:13:11,660
跟毛巾 拖鞋一起烧了
with the towel and the slippers.

382
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:12,580
烧了
Burn them?

383
00:13:12,940 --> 00:13:14,770
我的头发也粘到了
It's in my hair, too.

384
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,980
我来剪
Okay. I will cut it.

385
00:13:16,980 --> 00:13:20,980
去 跑去把剪刀拿给妈妈
Go. Grab some scissors and run them back to Mama.

386
00:13:20,980 --> 00:13:22,460
我去拿剪刀吧 乔
I'll get the scissors, Joe!

387
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:24,120
其实那沙鼠我都不想要
I didn't even want him,

388
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,860
我是唯一确保它活着的人
and I'm the only one keeping him alive.

389
00:13:25,860 --> 00:13:28,510
好了 得把这个弄平整
Okay, I just have to smooth this out

390
00:13:28,510 --> 00:13:30,230
杰就什么都不会发现了
so that Jay doesn't notice anything.

391
00:13:30,230 --> 00:13:31,070
为了瞒他
You're really going through

392
00:13:31,070 --> 00:13:32,780
你真是大费周章
a lot of trouble to hide this from him.

393
00:13:32,780 --> 00:13:34,290
你不明白
You just don't understand.

394
00:13:34,290 --> 00:13:35,700
这次吵架是有史以来
This is the first time in a fight

395
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:39,710
第一次我全对 杰全错的
that I was 100% right and Jay was 100% wrong.

396
00:13:39,710 --> 00:13:41,410
以前从未有过
That never happens.

397
00:13:41,410 --> 00:13:42,800
全对有那么重要吗
And being right is so important?

398
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,860
先结婚再跟老娘说话
Get married and then get back to me.

399
00:13:45,620 --> 00:13:47,840
不 卡住了 过来帮我一把
Ay, no! This is stuck! Come help me!

400
00:13:49,890 --> 00:13:50,860
推
Push!

401
00:13:55,570 --> 00:13:57,900
哦不 我的生日礼物劳力士
Oh, no! My birthday Rolex!

402
00:13:58,260 --> 00:13:59,660
想多了 曼尼
Ay, Manny.

403
00:14:01,380 --> 00:14:02,940
麻烦结账
We'll take the check, please.

404
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,340
不
No!

405
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,720
非常感谢
Thank you so much.

406
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:10,380
我超想睡的 菲尔
I want to go to sleep so bad, Phil.

407
00:14:11,660 --> 00:14:13,250
也许这个能让你醒着
Maybe this will keep you awake.

408
00:14:14,450 --> 00:14:16,420
我们家不可能这么远
Our house cannot be this far.

409
00:14:16,610 --> 00:14:18,880
我们已经走了
We've been walking for...

410
00:14:19,570 --> 00:14:21,470
我们已经走过这个床垫了
We've passed this mattress already.

411
00:14:22,510 --> 00:14:23,320
这就是命
It's fate.

412
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,930
上帝想让我睡觉
God wants me to sleep.

413
00:14:24,930 --> 00:14:26,600
坚持住 坚持住 克莱尔
Fight it! Fight it, Claire!

414
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,880
放开我
Let me go!

415
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:30,250
不行 不行 我们离目标很近了
No! No! We're so close!

416
00:14:30,250 --> 00:14:31,470
我不能让你放弃
I can't let you quit!

417
00:14:31,470 --> 00:14:35,050
天 我才不会在那么脏的垫子上睡...
Oh, God. I'm not gonna go to sleep on some filthy mattress...

418
00:14:35,050 --> 00:14:36,010
好吧
Okay.

419
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:36,850
太久
for long.

420
00:14:36,850 --> 00:14:37,790
不 不
No. No!

421
00:14:37,790 --> 00:14:39,380
对不起
No, no. I'm sorry.

422
00:14:39,380 --> 00:14:41,450
我上班已经很累了
I'm so tired from work already.

423
00:14:41,450 --> 00:14:42,960
我在巴黎玩不起来的
I won't be any fun in Paris.

424
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,050
你去吧
You should go.

425
00:14:44,060 --> 00:14:45,790
泡个妞 我不在乎
Meet someone. I don't care.

426
00:14:45,790 --> 00:14:47,950
我真的做不到 对不起
I just can't do it. I'm sorry.

427
00:14:50,130 --> 00:14:52,730
我们还是不去了吧
You know what? Let's not.

428
00:14:54,210 --> 00:14:55,710
我不该逼你
I shouldn't have pushed you.

429
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:58,630
我知道我说了不想变老之类的话
I know I said all that stuff about not wanting to get old,

430
00:14:58,630 --> 00:14:59,330
可是
but...

431
00:15:00,430 --> 00:15:02,990
我那么想去是因为我想你
I think I really wanted to go because I miss you.

432
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:06,800
因为我工作太忙了吗
Because I've been working so much?

433
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:07,790
是啊 忙挺好的
Yeah, which is great.

434
00:15:07,790 --> 00:15:09,150
我也希望你能充实自己
I-I really want that for you.

435
00:15:09,150 --> 00:15:10,250
我觉得我
I-I think I...

436
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:12,300
我只想来场冒险
I just wanted a little adventure.

437
00:15:12,310 --> 00:15:13,270
可你知道吗
But you know what?

438
00:15:13,810 --> 00:15:15,450
我们今晚已经很欢乐了
We've had so much fun tonight.

439
00:15:15,990 --> 00:15:16,700
我上次跟你
When was the last time

440
00:15:16,700 --> 00:15:19,290
熬夜到凌晨五点是什么时候
I got to stay up until 5:00 in the morning with you?

441
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,510
把手给我
Give me that hand.

442
00:15:21,510 --> 00:15:22,370
要做什么
What for?

443
00:15:23,410 --> 00:15:24,800
这一掌是为了让我清醒
That's to wake me up.

444
00:15:25,070 --> 00:15:27,540
这一掌是为惩罚我
And that is for ever forgetting

445
00:15:27,810 --> 00:15:30,260
忘了你是最棒的老公
that you are the best husband.

446
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:33,450
这是干吗
Oh. What's that for?

447
00:15:33,450 --> 00:15:34,790
拍死爬到我身上的东西
For whatever's crawling all over me!

448
00:15:34,790 --> 00:15:36,950
哦不 也爬到我身上了
Oh, no! They're on me, too!

449
00:15:38,470 --> 00:15:40,610
一小时40块 歌都在单子里
$40 for the hour. Songs are in the book.

450
00:15:40,610 --> 00:15:41,550
有人要鸡尾酒吗
Anyone want a cocktail?

451
00:15:41,550 --> 00:15:43,160
-你知道怎么调曼哈顿吗 -知道
- You know how to make a Manhattan? - Yes.

452
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,440
你不知道 曼哈顿只有...
No, you don't. The only Manhattan --

453
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,270
他知道了 爸
He's got it, Dad.

454
00:15:45,270 --> 00:15:46,970
谢谢 谢了
Thank you. Thanks.

455
00:15:47,370 --> 00:15:49,420
K歌厅
So, a karaoke bar, huh?

456
00:15:50,150 --> 00:15:51,690
你认为唱流行歌曲就能
You know, it's a little offensive that you think

457
00:15:51,690 --> 00:15:53,490
解决我的问题挺伤人的
singing a pop song is gonna solve my problems.

458
00:15:53,490 --> 00:15:54,460
你是认为我有多基
How gay do you think I am?

459
00:15:54,460 --> 00:15:55,270
米奇尔
Mitchell!

460
00:15:55,910 --> 00:15:56,850
麦当娜
Madonna!

461
00:15:57,750 --> 00:15:59,190
好吧 好吧
Oh! Yeah. Okay.

462
00:15:59,190 --> 00:16:00,100
来吧
Well, come on!

463
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:01,260
你小时候很紧张的时候
When you were stressed out as a kid,

464
00:16:01,260 --> 00:16:03,310
你会在客厅唱麦当娜的歌跳她的舞
you used to dance and sing Madonna in the living room.

465
00:16:03,310 --> 00:16:04,410
你马上就好了
Fixed you right up.

466
00:16:04,410 --> 00:16:05,630
我一点都不惊讶
Ah, I'm not surprised.

467
00:16:05,630 --> 00:16:07,680
你觉得我在过去25年里一点都没变
You think I haven't changed at all in 25 years.

468
00:16:07,690 --> 00:16:08,880
如果你真的感到惊讶 我就不会知道了
If you were surprised, I wouldn't know it,

469
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:11,050
因为你一直在拔眉毛
since you've plucked out all your eyebrows.

470
00:16:11,730 --> 00:16:12,870
麦当娜 米奇尔
Madonna, Mitchell.

471
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:15,130
告诉你吧 我不会唱的
News flash -- I am not singing.

472
00:16:15,130 --> 00:16:16,840
告诉你吧 你会的
News flash -- yes, you are!

473
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:17,510
你知道吗 爸
You know what, Dad?

474
00:16:17,510 --> 00:16:19,890
你今晚真的很霸道
You have been really bossy tonight.

475
00:16:20,020 --> 00:16:21,610
对我 对那个服务员
With me, with that waitress.

476
00:16:21,610 --> 00:16:24,590
我猜就是这样你才会和歌洛莉亚有矛盾
I-I bet that's why you and Gloria are having problems.

477
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,330
是的
Yeah.

478
00:16:25,470 --> 00:16:26,660
你怀念在工作中指挥别人
You miss bossing people around at work,

479
00:16:26,660 --> 00:16:27,900
所以现在你就在家这么做
so now you're doing it at home.

480
00:16:27,900 --> 00:16:29,810
如果我承认你说的有那么一点点对
If I admitted there was some truth in that,

481
00:16:29,810 --> 00:16:31,060
你能别硬撑着了吗
could you just give in?

482
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:33,360
你现在摇来摇去就像萝拉·法拉娜一样
You've been grinding around like Lola Falana.

483
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:35,680
我不知道为什么这对你来说这么重要
I don't know why this is so important to you.

484
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:37,320
你能不能让我帮你
Can you just let me help you?!

485
00:16:37,530 --> 00:16:39,240
好吧 我会唱的
Okay, I'm doing this,

486
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:41,800
但只是因为你需要我这么做
but only because you need it so much.

487
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:43,580
来吧 女孩
Come on, girls!

488
00:16:43,990 --> 00:16:45,450
你们相信爱吗
Do you believe in love?

489
00:16:45,450 --> 00:16:47,330
因为我对此有话要说
'Cause I got something to say about it.

490
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:49,970
它是这样的东西
And it goes something like this.

491
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:54,020
*不要退而求其次 宝贝*
*Don't go for second best, baby*

492
00:16:54,020 --> 00:16:56,490
*让你的爱接受考验*
*Put your love to the test*

493
00:16:56,490 --> 00:16:57,140
*你知道 你知道*
*You know, you know...*

494
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:59,010
看着米奇尔 解决了他的问题
Watching Mitchell, I did feel kind of good

495
00:16:59,010 --> 00:17:00,470
我确实感觉良好
about fixing his problem.

496
00:17:00,470 --> 00:17:03,530
现在退休了 你并不总能觉得自己有用
Now, being retired, you don't always feel useful anymore.

497
00:17:03,530 --> 00:17:05,610
也许这就是我要拆那间浴室的原因
It's probably why I keep tearing up that bathroom.

498
00:17:06,060 --> 00:17:09,430
我猜向歌洛莉亚坦白承认也不是什么坏事
I guess it wouldn't be the worst thing to admit to Gloria.

499
00:17:10,370 --> 00:17:12,070
也许时间久了就会被淡忘的
Eh, it'll probably blow over.

500
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:14,020
*表达你自己*
*Express yourself*

501
00:17:14,050 --> 00:17:15,050
我去
Damn it.

502
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:18,120
*表达你自己*
*Express yourself*

503
00:17:21,740 --> 00:17:24,090
我就知道你会辗转反侧睡不着
I knew you'd be up, tossing and turning.

504
00:17:24,090 --> 00:17:25,040
是的 是的
Yes, yes.

505
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:26,860
为什么你要在沙发上打电话给我
Why are you calling from the couch?

506
00:17:26,860 --> 00:17:28,040
我不在家 说来话长
Not home. Long story.

507
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,090
我要坦白
Look, let me get this out.

508
00:17:29,090 --> 00:17:31,520
我对那间浴室的事是有点过分
I have been going crazy with the bathroom,

509
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:33,690
但这不真的是因为浴室的原因
but it's not really about the bathroom.

510
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:36,400
是因为我不再知道我自己是谁了
It's about me not being sure who I am anymore.

511
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,870
你完全没错
You were 100% right.

512
00:17:37,870 --> 00:17:39,410
很高兴听你这么说 但...
I love to hear that, but...

513
00:17:39,410 --> 00:17:40,340
不 你是对的
No, you were.

514
00:17:40,340 --> 00:17:42,740
好吧 别急着回来
Okay. No rush getting home.

515
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:44,930
我们都很好
We're fine here.

516
00:17:44,930 --> 00:17:47,200
给力 给力 黑
Please, please, please! Come on, black!

517
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,410
红18号
18 red.

518
00:17:48,410 --> 00:17:49,310
红18号
18 red.

519
00:17:49,310 --> 00:17:50,650
就差一点
So close.

520
00:17:50,650 --> 00:17:53,350
赌博最好玩了
Gambling is the best!

521
00:17:53,350 --> 00:17:54,910
你把自己辛苦挣来的钱给陌生人
You hand your hard-earned money to strangers

522
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,320
祈祷能挣回来
and pray it comes back.

523
00:17:57,760 --> 00:17:58,970
我知道我喝了不少
I know I've had a lot to drink,

524
00:17:58,970 --> 00:18:01,430
但那已经不是比安卡了 对吗
but that is not Bianca anymore, is it?

525
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:02,660
是的
Nope.

526
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:04,930
克林特不会把她卖了吧
I don't want to believe Clint sold her...

527
00:18:04,930 --> 00:18:06,980
你们想要彻底疯狂起来吗
You guys want to get really crazy?

528
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:08,180
大家都知道我在哪里
People know where I am.

529
00:18:08,250 --> 00:18:10,470
全押在一个数字上
All-in on one number.

530
00:18:10,470 --> 00:18:12,180
好吧 我想再也没有
Okay, I guess that's no scarier

531
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:14,370
比那条荧光棒在我嘴里炸开更恐怖的事了
than when that glow-stick broke in my mouth.

532
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:15,110
去吧
Do it.

533
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,670
安迪 那是一个月的租金啊
Andy, that's, like, a month's rent.

534
00:18:18,670 --> 00:18:19,670
要玩就玩大的不然...
Hey, you got to go big or...

535
00:18:19,670 --> 00:18:21,420
等一下 黑色不是一美金的吗
Wait -- the black ones aren't $1s?

536
00:18:21,420 --> 00:18:22,610
真的吗 好吧 我能不能...
Really? Okay, could I just...

537
00:18:22,610 --> 00:18:23,770
对不起先生 球已经在转了
Sorry, sir. The ball's rolling.

538
00:18:23,770 --> 00:18:24,950
我的天啊
Oh, my gosh.

539
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,160
安迪 你究竟怎么了
Andy, what is happening with you?

540
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,500
为什么你要这么做
Why are you doing this?

541
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:29,300
你在说什么 我以为你喜欢狂野版的安迪
What are you talking about? I thought you loved Wild Andy.

542
00:18:29,300 --> 00:18:29,910
不 不
No, no.

543
00:18:29,910 --> 00:18:31,370
我喜欢正常版的安迪
I love Normal Andy,

544
00:18:31,370 --> 00:18:33,260
番茄汤和奶酪三明治的安迪
tomato-soup-and-grilled-cheese Andy.

545
00:18:33,260 --> 00:18:34,570
11点上床睡觉的安迪
Still-in-bed-by-11:00 Andy.

546
00:18:34,570 --> 00:18:35,860
喜欢说"小肚肚"的安迪
Uses-the-word-"Tummy" Andy.

547
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:37,720
真的吗 我这么做
Really? Because I've been doing this whole thing

548
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,510
全是因为我怕如果我没跟上你的节奏
because I was afraid you'd get bored and dump me

549
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:40,360
你会觉得无聊然后甩了我
if I couldn't keep up.

550
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:43,160
我知道你无法跟上我的节奏 但我愿意慢下来
I know you can't keep up. But I'd rather slow down.

551
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,970
我喜欢跟你在一起时的我
I like the me I am when I'm with you.

552
00:18:44,970 --> 00:18:47,370
我真希望你能在一分钟前告诉我
Well, I wish you would have told me that about a minute ago.

553
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:48,830
我不敢看
I can't watch!

554
00:18:48,830 --> 00:18:50,500
压力在我的小肚肚里翻腾
The stress is murder on my tummy.

555
00:18:53,180 --> 00:18:54,360
小帕阿姨要走了
Aunt Pam's leaving.

556
00:18:56,230 --> 00:18:58,310
帕梅隆·杰西卡·塔克 你是想去哪里
Pameron Jessica Tucker, where do you think you're going?

557
00:18:58,310 --> 00:19:01,110
回家 跪在博的面前 求他回心转意
Home -- to get down on my knees and beg Bo to come back.

558
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:03,300
我会撒谎告诉他我怀孕了
I'm just gonna lie and tell him I'm pregnant.

559
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:06,310
不 那不是成熟的大人处理事情的方式
No, that is not how mature people handle their problems.

560
00:19:06,410 --> 00:19:07,520
我会跟你决斗的
I will fight you.

561
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:10,280
你不能回去向那个男人低头
You are not going to crawl back to that man.

562
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,550
你没有话语权 你知道我能打败你
You don't have a choice. You know I can take you.

563
00:19:12,550 --> 00:19:13,720
是吗
Oh, yeah, right.

564
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:17,900
帕梅隆 不
Pameron -- No!

565
00:19:18,650 --> 00:19:20,460
好吧 你知道吗
Okay, you know what?

566
00:19:20,780 --> 00:19:23,050
你会后悔这么做的
You are going to regret that!

567
00:19:23,990 --> 00:19:26,370
你惹毛我了
Oh, now you poked the bear!

568
00:19:26,650 --> 00:19:28,070
来吧 熊妈妈
Well, come on, Mama Bear!

569
00:19:28,070 --> 00:19:29,340
我来了
I'm coming!

570
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:33,920
反正这都是我的错
It's all my fault anyway!

571
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,900
是我让他走的
I pushed him away!

572
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:38,570
因为我从不听他说
Because I never listened!

573
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:42,220
你真的想让莉莉以为女人都是脆弱的吗
You really want Lily to think women are weak?!

574
00:19:42,220 --> 00:19:44,210
离我大爸远点
Get off my daddy!

575
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:47,580
你就因为一个男生变得这么疯狂吗
You're acting this crazy all over a boy?!

576
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:49,390
莉莉 很高兴能听到你这么说
Oh, Lily, I'm so happy to hear you say that!

577
00:19:49,390 --> 00:19:51,130
快拉开帕梅隆阿姨的胸罩扣
Now, pull Aunt Pameron's bra strap!

578
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:55,100
好吧 我们移开了沙发
Okay. So we moved the couch.

579
00:19:55,840 --> 00:19:56,990
你去哪里了
Where were you?

580
00:19:56,990 --> 00:19:58,740
我 我有些工作要做
I, uh, I had some work to do.

581
00:19:58,910 --> 00:20:01,700
我也是 我要找回我的男人
Me too. Get my man back.

582
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:03,670
好吧 好吧
Okay. Okay. All right.

583
00:20:03,670 --> 00:20:05,600
虽然我真的很想不管
As much as I'd love to leave this alone,

584
00:20:05,780 --> 00:20:06,730
但我今晚学到了一些东西
I learned something tonight

585
00:20:06,730 --> 00:20:08,640
我觉得我要分享给你听
that I feel like I-I need to share with you.

586
00:20:09,780 --> 00:20:12,450
你值得得到生命中最好的事物
You deserve the best in life.

587
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:15,950
所以如果时机不对 那就转身离开吧
So if the time isn't right, then...move on.

588
00:20:16,670 --> 00:20:18,080
退而求其次 这...
Second best, it's...

589
00:20:18,490 --> 00:20:19,890
这配不上你
It's never enough.

590
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,920
你自己会过得更好 宝贝[麦当娜歌词]
You'll do much better, baby, on your own.

591
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:23,020
宝贝
Baby.

592
00:20:24,170 --> 00:20:25,130
你自己
On your own.

593
00:20:26,110 --> 00:20:27,480
我的天啊
My God.

594
00:20:28,510 --> 00:20:29,900
你说得对
You're right.

595
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,480
是的
Yeah.

596
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:35,030
不要退而求其次
Don't go for second best.

597
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:37,160
-让你的爱... -没事 我解决了
- Put your love... - It's okay. I fixed her.

598
00:20:37,490 --> 00:20:38,730
是麦当娜解决了
Madonna fixed her.

599
00:20:43,450 --> 00:20:44,910
别担心 我们有钱的
Don't worry. We've got this.

600
00:20:44,910 --> 00:20:46,010
慢慢来
Take all the time you need.

601
00:20:46,010 --> 00:20:48,520
我只不过是要结束一次12小时的轮班而已
I'm only finishing a 12-hour shift.

602
00:20:48,790 --> 00:20:50,640
你有五美分或十美分什么的吗
Do you got a nickel or a dime or anything?

603
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:51,710
没有
I don't.

604
00:20:51,710 --> 00:20:52,880
对不起 那么...
Sorry, but...

605
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:55,010
你可能就要找我零钱了
you're gonna have to make change.

606
00:20:58,990 --> 00:20:59,770
什么
What?!

607
00:20:59,770 --> 00:21:01,650
我爸妈要去巴黎了
My mom and dad are going to Paris.

608
00:21:01,650 --> 00:21:05,280
好吧 通知了孩子 拿好了护照
Okay, children informed, passports secured,

609
00:21:05,280 --> 00:21:06,890
收拾好了行李
luggage packed.

610
00:21:07,730 --> 00:21:08,960
我忘了什么
What am I forgetting?

611
00:21:28,360 --> 00:21:28,840
对了
Oh, yeah.

612
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,140
再会[法语] 艾丽克斯
Au revoir, Alex!

613
00:21:34,580 --> 00:21:36,340
下一站 天堂之城
Next stop, Paradise City.

614
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,280
那是枪炮与玫瑰的歌
Guns and Roses.
